  "Implemented": [
    "New desktop runs default to Automatic (prefer real CUDA); explicit GPU and CPU controls. Device probing is asynchronous. Presets preserve choice; saved records restore recorded choice.",
    "Original shared Core formulas and nominal roots are recorded into bounded derivative tapes; origin tangents and implicit stop constraints are preserved. GPU computes double-precision reverse gradients for five ray outputs.",
    "Automatic records CPU fallback reason for missing CUDA, CUDA faults or unsupported tangent range. Forced GPU never silently reports CPU as GPU. Original CPU behavior and historical omitted-device identities preserved.",
    "Actual successful GPU batch/ray/time metadata is persisted and validated. Cancellation and graph/memory bounds retained. AutoLens-only optimizer and zero native target polish unchanged.",
    "ILGPU package version and 19 current project dependency locks updated; DLL and original NCSA/third-party notices required by standard packaging. No CUDA driver or toolkit redistributed."
  ],
